Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.01,0:00:00.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolfgang Reviewer The
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.99,0:00:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,second one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.90,0:00:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.23,0:00:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Iron
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.14,0:00:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that is near\Nthe end of the journey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,THE END
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.39,0:01:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.99,0:02:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.99,0:03:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.07,0:06:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that, a helicopter?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Speedwagon Foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,They're looking for a\Nsolid place to touch down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Speed Wagon Foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.41,0:06:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,They're your associates that are taking\Ncare of Mom in Japan, right, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.38,0:06:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna have to ride in that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I wish we could\Nhitch a ride with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But those young men aren't stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,If the enemy should attack us,\Nwe'd end up involving them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what is that helicopter\Ndoing here, Jostar-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.49,0:06:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I've requested they bring in backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:50.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got a bit of an attitude problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,so it took a lot of hard\Nwork to get him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.03,0:07:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.94,0:07:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, it is not possible for\Nhim to accompany us on this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.05,0:07:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He cannot back us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you know him, Avdor-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.67,0:07:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If he's going to back us up, then\Nhe must be a stand user, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, and this stand user is represented\Nby the tarot card, The Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.27,0:07:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool or do you mean the idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like his card might\Nbe lacking a little upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be glad he is not your enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.91,0:08:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You would never beat him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You got a lot of nerve\Ntalking to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.91,0:08:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.27,0:08:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now take your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off, Victor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.03,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like the helicopter's landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.43,0:08:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.34,0:08:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, we're glad to\Nsee you're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.65,0:08:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.23,0:08:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Which one of you guys is the stand user?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.79,0:09:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, which one of you is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.55,0:09:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.57,0:09:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's actually neither one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's here in the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.33,0:09:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.41,0:09:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What, huh? Who, huh? Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.35,0:09:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.26,0:09:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he a shrimp?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.41,0:09:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.91,0:09:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, watch out! Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's in a really bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The ride over was pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.17,0:09:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you he has an attitude problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now step back, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.97,0:10:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,A dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.83,0:10:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, this can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.99,0:10:18.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this dog is the\Nstand user of the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Iggy, and he loves\Nto pull and chew on human hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows where he came from,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.43,0:10:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and when the animal control officers\Nin New York weren't able to catch him,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.89,0:10:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol was called in to get the job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.83,0:10:37.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and yes, when Iggy chews on a\Nperson's hair, he has a tendency to fart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nasty habit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.65,0:10:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off, you damn dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.09,0:10:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut the air up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.01,0:11:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't cut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.11,0:11:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, it is a\NStand of the Sand they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.77,0:11:37.73,Default,,0,0,0,,simplicity is power i'm not\Nsure i could beat him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.81,0:11:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,hey help me get rid of this damn dog
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.65,0:11:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,do you have some of his favorite treats?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, there's no way we could\Nhave brought him here without it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.83,0:11:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't let him see the box!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a big weakness for\Ncoffee-flavored chewing gum.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.43,0:12:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But Iggy is the type who will\Nnever allow himself to be tamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.49,0:12:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,At least take off the wrapper first.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How is a dog supposed\Nto serve as a backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.83,0:13:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,A dog who's a stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.11,0:13:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the food and water you'll\Nneed for the rest of the trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,These other crates contain medical\Nsupplies and extra clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.51,0:13:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you leave, I'd\Nlike to ask you one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.49,0:13:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.40,0:13:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,it's about my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.81,0:13:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How is Holly's medical condition?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold anything back from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.51,0:13:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm afraid I have some bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.01,0:14:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not doing very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.07,0:14:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter's rapidly losing strength,\Nand her life is still in grave danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,According to the prognosis of\Nthe Foundation's physicians,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.07,0:14:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,at best, she has two more weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.95,0:14:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.45,0:14:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Only two weeks left, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.37,0:14:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.47,0:15:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.03,0:16:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Now why is this shitty mud\Nallowed to be on the seat,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,and we have to plant our\Nasses on the bed of the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.75,0:16:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My butt is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.59,0:16:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just wait until\Nthe gum loses flavor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.73,0:16:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as it grows stale,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,lure him to the back of the truck with a\Nnew piece of gum and then grab the seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.13,0:16:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,God damn you, dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.01,0:16:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.03,0:16:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, that is in the direction\Nthe helicopter was headed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.45,0:17:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No sign of any damage from weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like it just slammed into\Nthe ground. An accident? Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.79,0:17:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quite possible this could be\Nan attack from an enemy's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.99,0:18:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, it's the pilot. He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You never know what's lurking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.97,0:18:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's scratch marks on the fuselage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Water?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.83,0:18:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A ton of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,From his mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:38.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, from his lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.37,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.79,0:18:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy drowned in the\Nmiddle of the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.31,0:18:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.53,0:19:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.45,0:19:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's the other one!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.65,0:19:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.61,0:19:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.75,0:19:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.66,0:19:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, here, take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.85,0:19:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.89,0:19:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's water. Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:35.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The water!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.41,0:19:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's attacking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.99,0:19:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.59,0:19:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an enemy stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.85,0:20:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The enemy's stand is hiding\Ninside the canteen. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.53,0:20:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's to be gained by attacking those\Ninnocent men from Speed, Foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.61,0:20:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Avdol, did you see what\Nkind of stand it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.25,0:20:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,All I saw was the hand, but it\Nis still inside the canteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.07,0:20:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have not seen it come out of there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.11,0:20:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, search for the enemy's main body.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.99,0:20:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm searching for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.07,0:20:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see the main body anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.47,0:20:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.38,0:20:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's controlling\Nit from a distance,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.91,0:20:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,and the stand seems to be pretty small.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:20:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, attack the canteen. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.99,0:21:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You're asking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you even here when the\Nentire head of the pilot
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.41,0:21:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,got sucked through the\Ntiny hole of the canteen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.91,0:21:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If I puncture any holes\Nin that thing, who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.03,0:21:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.27,0:21:14.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're closer to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.45,0:21:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just use your emerald\Nsplash and blow it the hell out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.47,0:21:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to do it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.31,0:21:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't try to get me to do\Nwhat you don't want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.83,0:21:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of twisted\Nmind do you have, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.99,0:21:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It got Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.11,0:21:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It got Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.95,0:21:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kakyoin! Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It got his eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:21:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff, don't panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.61,0:22:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Use Chariot to protect\Nyourself in Kakyoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.05,0:22:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.03,0:22:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it bother to\Nattack the pilot's dead body?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.13,0:22:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.65,0:22:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It didn't go after the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.21,0:22:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It went after the watch's alarm instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.07,0:22:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.45,0:22:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it uses sound to find its targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.45,0:23:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Run for the truck, Baldoref!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.41,0:23:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the rep. Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.55,0:23:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull him up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.89,0:23:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.47,0:24:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.97,0:24:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we cannot get out of the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.99,0:24:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard, how dare you\Ndo something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.85,0:24:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm starting up the truck what
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.13,0:24:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.04,0:24:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Joestar, don't tell me\Nyou're running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.99,0:24:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, the priority is to\Nget away from that stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.13,0:25:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.21,0:25:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The escape by truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.11,0:25:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Evidently, they know now that I and Duel\Ncan detect even the slightest sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.13,0:25:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Although knowing that fact isn't\Ngoing to help them too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.07,0:26:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Since our enemy seems to\Nmove by detecting sound,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.33,0:26:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,it can move throughout the sand\Nwithout exposing itself to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.71,0:26:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It can attack us from any direction\Nbefore we even notice it's there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.59,0:26:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And what's worse, the main body\Ndoesn't have to be anywhere near it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.33,0:26:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Kakyoin doing? It's bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.69,0:26:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He could lose his sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to get him to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.11,0:26:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.53,0:26:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.45,0:27:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,There is water in the club?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.97,0:27:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The dog escaped from the truck before.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.77,0:27:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,my attack began that could be a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.43,0:27:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll take care of it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.07,0:27:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.67,0:27:25.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.23,0:27:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Chariot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.47,0:27:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.93,0:27:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna jump you into pieces this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.49,0:27:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull around!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.21,0:27:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.93,0:28:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.93,0:28:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.91,0:28:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,what's going on with this... thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.51,0:28:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It combined with more water.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.23,0:28:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.01,0:28:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He will suffocate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.27,0:28:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.65,0:28:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Magicians, red!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.75,0:28:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Red boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.95,0:28:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ballarat, spit the\Nwater outside the truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.73,0:29:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.03,0:29:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think we should do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.77,0:29:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless we find the enemy's\Nmain body, we're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.19,0:29:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Old man, the water and the radiator. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.95,0:29:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.61,0:29:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.69,0:30:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.73,0:30:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No one, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.39,0:30:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not make a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.93,0:31:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where each one of you landed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.43,0:31:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the precision of a surgeon!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.07,0:31:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.75,0:31:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,One by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.61,0:31:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a very tough stand to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.75,0:31:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.79,0:31:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.43,0:32:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Vincero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.57,0:32:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Vincero.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.83,0:32:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.57,0:32:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.91,0:33:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.63,0:34:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.47,0:34:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Is Is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.17,0:34:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Is Is
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.89,0:34:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
